  "details": "I work with Large avatars, so I often have to scale down if I want to chat. It's hard to reset my model while using it; when I'm in a small area, crowded with people. If I reset, I would squish everyone and blocks their vision.\n\nBefore, I could avoid squashing everyone with my feet. Only because I was able to reset the height after I change my model and reset my model after. \n\nAlso the Menu looks ugly... Please put it back. I prefer making the menu more creator friendly for testing our models.",
